1
00:00:01,599 --> 00:00:09,519
Mm… — Go put on the bunny suit
and make me happy.

2
00:00:09,519 --> 00:00:12,509
You're such a pervert, P'Gun.

3
00:00:12,509 --> 00:00:14,731
So? You gonna do it or not?
It's extra work.

4
00:00:14,731 --> 00:00:20,393
At first I didn't care.
But now I kinda wanna charge you interest.

5
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,527
You're evil.

6
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:24,641
You forced me to be like this, Earth.

7
00:00:26,161 --> 00:00:29,328
You can't even put on a simple outfit.
And you think you can do extra work?

8
00:00:29,813 --> 00:00:31,114
I *can* do it.

9
00:00:32,768 --> 00:00:36,193
Fine. I'll prove it.
I'll make you soften up.

10
00:00:37,379 --> 00:00:38,835
I'll be waiting.

11
00:00:38,835 --> 00:00:42,729
Or go die and reincarnate as a bunny.

12
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,719
Go put it on.

13
00:01:05,479 --> 00:01:11,439
Come here, little bunny.

14
00:01:13,627 --> 00:01:17,680
Hey! Hurry up, my little bunny.

15
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:23,600
- What the—
- What is this, P'Gun?

16
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,839
What are you doing? Let go.

17
00:01:29,053 --> 00:01:34,233
I'm not letting go.
Don't be scared— I'm not a lion.

18
00:01:35,235 --> 00:01:37,663
You're scarier than a lion!

19
00:01:37,663 --> 00:01:39,901
Let me go change. Let go!

20
00:01:42,256 --> 00:01:45,680
No. You look cute in this one.

21
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:49,202
- No! I'm not wearing it.
- Hey—

22
00:01:50,759 --> 00:01:52,721
P'Gun!

23
00:01:52,721 --> 00:01:56,418
Hey— let go, P'Gun!

24
00:01:58,289 --> 00:02:00,062
I said let go. I have to go to work.

25
00:02:00,313 --> 00:02:03,580
A little bunny can work too?
